    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.4</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:15:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>66</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Live LUT 0.3.4</h2><p>Program screen: the TV button (and "Also on the SDI output" under Picture tools) puts false color, focus peaking and zebras on the TVs too, like a field monitor. Zoom never gets them, a red TOOLS ON SDI OUT tag shows while it is on, and it is off again every time Live LUT starts.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Tint: double-click (or Reset all) now sets tint to neutral 0 on every camera.</p>
<p>Mode: Auto | Setup | Program. Auto follows Movie Recorder and shows which mode it's in.</p>
<p>Scopes on each picture (waveform, RGB parade, vectorscope, histogram) from the picture's bar.</p>
<p>Frame guides from the picture's bar: aspect ratios (16:9, 4:3, 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 1.85, 2.35, 2.39), centre cross, thirds, safe areas.</p>
<p>False color "Simple": good exposure stays grey, yellow = too bright, red = clipped, blue/purple = too dark ("Zones" still available).</p>
<p>Exposure match: all four cameras side by side with how many stops each is off, Match / Match all buttons, and Link to adjust all cameras together (not focus).</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/composrr/live-lut-releases/releases/download/v0.3.4/Live-LUT-0.3.4.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zHwnoIbEX6zzBwaYc6C6oW4Hc/DXRAquuicm/4AT7dWrCDivPT+kdi+dbng07NIvKNRd53Y9y8df/SXPv5SMAw==" length="4264022" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.3</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:53:58 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>61</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Live LUT 0.3.3</h2><p>Fixed: the program SDI output could never open ("No DeckLink output"), and Settings › Studio › Program output listed no connectors. Every DeckLink connector that can play out is now listed.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/composrr/live-lut-releases/releases/download/v0.3.3/Live-LUT-0.3.3.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="i3cBVEJ0prOJkb7Y5EU4j7hgCzj+/UkDia0eJcG9Ix9fAXlxqDcokVh4bek5ueqXnn4xnDPms7BnkWhMwfh7BA==" length="4217386" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.2</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:46:17 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>59</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Live LUT 0.3.2</h2><p>Magnify 2× / 4× on every camera and the program picture (button on the picture's bar; drag to move around).</p>
<p>Scopes under the camera controls: waveform, RGB parade and histogram, with clipped and crushed percentages.</p>
<p>Picture tools with full names: false color, focus peaking, zebras.</p>
<p>Tint now reads 0 at neutral, minus toward green and plus toward magenta, with a Neutral (0) button.</p>
<p>"Auto Switch" replaces "Follow Movie Recorder".</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/composrr/live-lut-releases/releases/download/v0.3.2/Live-LUT-0.3.2.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="BspHEpEbRvMXhSYFWB8Mb9Fsg3FT4D70dwu82kgbPeJO2vn8pSU63kPfHDQcSVf5GXf2INQVMdKhmbOrx6bcAg==" length="4215316" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:36:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>57</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Live LUT 0.3.1</h2><p>Fixed: changing the shutter could nearly close it (unit mix-up), making the picture very dark.</p>
<p>Iris now works in real f-stops: the number updates instantly and is checked against the camera.</p>
<p>Double-click any camera value to put it back to where it was when Live LUT connected; Reset all does them all.</p>
<p>Click the big value to type a number (e.g. 5600 for white balance).</p>
<p>Click-to-focus: press the target icon on the picture's bar, then click where to focus.</p>
<p>Copy to other cameras now shows a tick or a warning per camera.</p>
<p>"Follow Movie Recorder" is now a labelled switch.</p>
<p>Program "no signal" shows a checklist of what to check.</p>
<p>Settings › Studio: every hub port, camera input, recording output and TV can be changed.</p>
<p>Settings › Cameras: Identify (colour bars for 3 s) and Swap, for when a camera's picture and control are crossed.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/composrr/live-lut-releases/releases/download/v0.3.1/Live-LUT-0.3.1.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wUHK/FJY2jydOsNrYDGvUC+QoD81TeVU4ko73LMNgtOLiWZyLs3FcQMliTbPmBjJf+7oCXsYwAIYSSfDI3GPBw==" length="4172349" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:16:50 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>55</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Live LUT 0.3.0</h2><p>New look: dark, minimal, bigger pictures.</p>
<p>Setup layouts: 2×2, one big + three, single camera, side by side (toolbar or ⌥⌘1–4). Click a picture to select it, double-click to show it alone.</p>
<p>Camera control for the four Blackmagic cameras: iris, ISO, shutter, white balance, tint, focus and AF, copy settings to other cameras. Set the camera addresses in Settings › Cameras (macOS asks for Local Network access the first time).</p>
<p>False color, zebras and focus peaking per camera, in Live LUT's window only (never on the TVs or Zoom).</p>
<p>New Program screen with big switcher keys, and a restyled menu bar.</p>
<p>Camera power is not active yet: it needs a network power strip.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/composrr/live-lut-releases/releases/download/v0.3.0/Live-LUT-0.3.0.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="kuVU/Y/RKnh5OUZB1Q5ygX90aaKdM8mtipYKsHcT5F4MwxWADFQ9e5t+rMBiipdJiu2jQHmsIag6WrMrCA99BA==" length="4074428" />
    </item>
